/em>","iit-basic-b09":"آب‌وهوا: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's snowing.</em>","iit-basic-s01":"هوا: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-basic-s02":"ساعت: <em dir=\"ltr\">What time is it?</em>","iit-basic-s03":"هوا: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-there-it-b01":"وجود داشتن: <em dir=\"ltr\">There's.</em>","iit-there-it-b02":"همان آهنگ: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-there-it-b03":"گفتن اینکه چه کسی یا چه چیزی است: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-there-it-b04":"اول <em dir=\"ltr\">There's</em> (چیزی تازه)، بعد <em dir=\"ltr\">it.</em>","iit-there-it-b05":"وجود داشتن: <em dir=\"ltr\">There are.</em>","iit-there-it-b06":"همان پارک: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-there-it-b07":"موقعیت: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's too hot.</em>","iit-there-it-b08":"وجود داشتن: <em dir=\"ltr\">Are there…?</em>","iit-there-it-b09":"وجود داشتن: <em dir=\"ltr\">Is there…?</em>","iit-there-it-s01":"وجود دارد (اولین بار): <em dir=\"ltr\">There's.</em>","iit-there-it-s02":"همان نامه: <em dir=\"ltr\">It's.</em>","iit-there-it-s03":"وجود دارد: <em dir=\"ltr\">Is there…?</em>"}}
